Package: SenSmooth
Title: Sen and Siegel Smooth Methods
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Daniel", "Nidzgorski", , "dnidz@civiceco.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: This package adds Sen and Siegel non-parametric smooth methods for use in ggplot2::ggsmooth(). These methods calculate slopes between all pairs of points. The Sen method takes the median slope, and the Siegel method takes the nested median. 
